  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring the Standby Phase: You can target up
    to 2 cards in the Pendulum Zones; their Pendulum Scales become 0 until the end
    of this turn. You can only use this effect of \"D/D Scale Surveyor\" once per
    turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you control a \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster Card:
    You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Normal or Special
    Summoned: You can make this card Level 4. If this card is sent to the GY, or
    added to the Extra Deck face-up: You can target 1 \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster Card
    you control; return it to the hand. You can only use each effect of \"D/D Scale
    Surveyor\" once per turn."
